    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/4dbab3618caf90af36346c0fa8c746fe.poster.avif?t=1753244540\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/4dbab3618caf90af36346c0fa8c746fe.webm?t=1753244540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/4dbab3618caf90af36346c0fa8c746fe.mp4?t=1753244540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Tenants,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, residents have frequently reported strange noises emanating from the fourth floor late at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After investigation, the elevator service at the fourth floor has been suspended temporarily. We apologize for any inconvenience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find yourself trapped on the fourth floor, please stay calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe  observe observe observe observe\u00a0carefully the corridor on the fourth floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If no anomalies are detected, please return by the same route.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If any anomalies are found, proceed forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new God of the Land has arrived in the stairwell, warding off evil and ensuring peacefulness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A professional practitioner will visit this month to conduct a purification ritual. Please rest assured of your safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishing you peace and well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra-Realistic Rendering:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Unreal Engine 5 and a vast library of scanned assets, the game brings a highly immersive, hyper-realistic Chinese retro-horror environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Scene-Based Storytelling:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover connections between anomalies, and peel back the layers of mystery surrounding the stories of the fourth-floor residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond \u201cSpot the Difference\u201d:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to pass through? The deep-dwelling residents of the fourth floor have their own rules\u2026</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/4dbab3618caf90af36346c0fa8c746fe.poster.avif?t=1753244540\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/4dbab3618caf90af36346c0fa8c746fe.webm?t=1753244540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873810/extras/4dbab3618caf90af36346c0fa8c746fe.mp4?t=1753244540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear Tenants,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, residents have frequently reported strange noises emanating from the fourth floor late at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After investigation, the elevator service at the fourth floor has been suspended temporarily. We apologize for any inconvenience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find yourself trapped on the fourth floor, please stay calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe  observe observe observe observe\u00a0carefully the corridor on the fourth floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If no anomalies are detected, please return by the same route.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If any anomalies are found, proceed forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new God of the Land has arrived in the stairwell, warding off evil and ensuring peacefulness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A professional practitioner will visit this month to conduct a purification ritual. Please rest assured of your safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishing you peace and well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra-Realistic Rendering:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Unreal Engine 5 and a vast library of scanned assets, the game brings a highly immersive, hyper-realistic Chinese retro-horror environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Scene-Based Storytelling:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover connections between anomalies, and peel back the layers of mystery surrounding the stories of the fourth-floor residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond \u201cSpot the Difference\u201d:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to pass through? The deep-dwelling residents of the fourth floor have their own rules\u2026</p>",
